            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Typical NAS with the defined technical specifications.\n\n# Included processes\nNetwork attached storage (NAS) is modeled as a small desktop with defined technical specifications of a Synology DS220+ (Synology, 2023). The key technical specifications, which are available in the product datasheet of Synology DS220+, include: CPU Intel Celeron J4025 2-core 2.0 GHz, 2 GB RAM capacity, 4 TB 2.5" HDD storage capacity, system fan, cables, 1 power adaptor, and packaging. The total weight of the modeled NAS is 1.30 kg (without HDDs).</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
